

; Ender 3 Pro with BLTouch - Start G-code
G92 E0                      ; Reset Extruder
G28                         ; Home all axes
G29                         ; Bed Leveling (BLTouch)

G1 Z2.0 F3000               ; Move Z Axis up a bit to prevent scratching
G1 X0.1 Y20 Z0.3 F5000.0    ; Move to start position
G1 X0.1 Y200.0 Z0.3 F1500.0 E15 ; Prime line 1
G1 X0.4 Y200.0 Z0.3 F5000.0     ; Move slightly right
G1 X0.4 Y20 Z0.3 F1500.0 E30    ; Prime line 2
G92 E0                      ; Reset Extruder again
G1 Z2.0 F3000               ; Lift to avoid blob
G1 X5 Y20 Z0.3 F5000.0      ; Move over to prevent blob squish


; Ender 3 Pro with BLTouch - End G-code
G91 ; Switch to relative positioning
G1 E-1 F300 ; Retract 1mm of filament to prevent oozing
G1 Z+5 E-5 X0 Y0 F9000 ; Move the nozzle up and out of the print area
G28 X0 Y0 ; Home the X and Y axes to the front

M104 S0 ; Turn off the hotend heater
M140 S0 ; Turn off the heated bed
M107 ; Turn off the fan
M84 ; Disable motors to reduce power consumption and noise
